    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "chuci-01-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n饮余马于咸池兮，\n\n总余辔乎扶桑。\n\n折若木以拂日兮，\n\n聊逍"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "chuci-02-07",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "暾将出兮东方,\n\n照吾槛兮扶桑。\n\n抚余马兮安驱,\n\n夜皎皎"
    },
    {
